# IMPLEMENTATION_STEPS: cu-002

1. Copy `pipelines/ingestion/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/env/DotEnv.scala` to `pipelines/enrichment/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/env/DotEnv.scala`. The copy is byte-identical; ARCH.STANDALONE requires duplication, not abstraction.

   Prove: `test -f pipelines/enrichment/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/env/DotEnv.scala && diff -q pipelines/ingestion/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/env/DotEnv.scala pipelines/enrichment/src/main/scala/newspipe/infrastructure/env/DotEnv.scala && echo IDENTICAL`

2. Copy `pipelines/ingestion/src/test/scala/newspipe/DotEnvSpec.scala` to `pipelines/enrichment/src/test/scala/newspipe/DotEnvSpec.scala`, byte-identical, then run the suite from `pipelines/enrichment`.

   Prove: `cd pipelines/enrichment && sbt "testOnly newspipe.DotEnvSpec"`

3. Compile the enrichment tree so the new adapter is proven to resolve against the existing sources.

   Prove: `cd pipelines/enrichment && sbt compile`

Do NOT touch: `pipelines/enrichment/**` unless this CU names it, `pipelines/ingestion/**` (cu-001 owns that tree's copy), `.LLMDD/**`, `conf/**`, `README.md`.
Stop when the stated Prove command exits 0. On failure, record the failing case and the observed value in per-CU feedback rather than weakening an assertion.
